{"root_text": {"uid": "ja31", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "කුළාවක ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Dancing ", "uid": "ja32"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Pig Named Munika ", "uid": "ja30"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja31' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>4. කුළාවක වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>31. කුළාවක ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv31' href='#msdiv31'>Msdiv 31</a>“මාතලී දිව්‍ය පුත්‍රය, හිඹුල් වනයෙහි සුපර්ණ පෝතකයෝ (හෙවත්) ගුරුළු පැටව් වසන කූඩු රථ ශීර්ෂයෙන් දුරුකරව. අසුරයන් කෙරෙහි ඒකාන්තයෙන්ම අපගේ ප්‍රාණය හරිමු. මේ ගුරුළු පැටව් පහවූ කූඩුවක ඇත්තෝ නොවෙත්වායි.”</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>කුලාවකජාතකං පඨමං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "translation": {"uid": "ja31", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "කුළාවක ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Dancing ", "uid": "ja32"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Pig Named Munika ", "uid": "ja30"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja31' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>4. කුළාවක වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>31. කුළාවක ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv31' href='#msdiv31'>Msdiv 31</a>“මාතලී දිව්‍ය පුත්‍රය, හිඹුල් වනයෙහි සුපර්ණ පෝතකයෝ (හෙවත්) ගුරුළු පැටව් වසන කූඩු රථ ශීර්ෂයෙන් දුරුකරව. අසුරයන් කෙරෙහි ඒකාන්තයෙන්ම අපගේ ප්‍රාණය හරිමු. මේ ගුරුළු පැටව් පහවූ කූඩුවක ඇත්තෝ නොවෙත්වායි.”</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>කුලාවකජාතකං පඨමං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "segmented": false, "suttaplex": {"acronym": "Ja 31", "alt_acronym": null, "volpages": "PTS 1.203", "alt_volpages": null, "uid": "ja31", "blurb": "“Let all the forest’s nestlings.”—This story was told by the Master while at Jetavana, about a brother who drank water without straining it.", "difficulty": null, "original_title": "Kulāvakajātaka", "root_lang": "pli", "root_lang_name": "Pāli", "type": "leaf", "from": null, "translated_title": "කුළාවක ජාතකය", "translations": [{"lang": "de", "lang_name": "Deutsch", "is_root": false, "author": "Sabbamitta", "author_sho